"name":794},"select-menu-search",[313,796,798],{"id":797},"variants","Variants",[288,800,801,802,805,806,358,809,812,813,337],{},"Uses the ",[291,803,804],{},"variant",", ",[291,807,808],{},"color",[291,810,811],{},"highlight"," of ",[291,814,762],{},[339,816],{"name":817},"select-menu-variant",[313,819,821],{"id":820},"icon","Icon",[288,823,801,824,358,826,812,829,831,832,834,835,837],{},[291,825,820],{},[291,827,828],{},"trailing-icon",[291,830,762],{},"; ",[291,833,820],{}," shows on the left, and ",[291,836,828],{}," replaces the arrow on the right.",[339,839],{"name":840},"select-menu-icon",[313,842,844],{"id":843},"size-and-states","Size and states",[288,846,847,848,851],{},"While loading, a spinner replaces the arrow on the right and the menu is disabled. Switching to skeleton, disabled or loading closes an open menu, and it does not reopen afterwards. See ",[300,849,102],{"href":850},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[339,853],{"name":854},"select-menu-states",[308,856,858],{"id":857},"examples","Examples",[313,860,862],{"id":861},"with-form-validation","With form validation",[288,864,865,866,868,869,872,873,868,875,337],{},"An empty single selection is ",[291,867,328],{},", so use ",[291,870,871],{},"requiredText","; an empty multiple selection is ",[291,874,336],{},[291,876,877],{},"requiredArray",[339,879],{"name":880},"select-menu-validation",[313,882,884],{"id":883},"truncated-text-tooltip","Truncated text tooltip",[288,886,887,888,891,892,298,895,899],{},"When the selected text is wider than the field, it is truncated with an ellipsis, and a tooltip shows the full text on hover or focus, or on long press on touch devices (see ",[300,889,217],{"href":890},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","); a long press does not open the menu. The tooltip is not shown while the menu is open. Set the width on ",[291,893,894],{},"ui.wrapper",[300,896,898],{"href":897},"#styling","Styling"," below.",[339,901],{"name":902},"select-menu-truncate",[313,904,906],{"id":905},"loading-items-asynchronously","Loading items asynchronously",[288,908,909,910,913,914,916,917,920],{},"While fetching items from the back end, use ",[291,911,912],{},"loading"," to show a spinner and disable the menu, then fill in ",[291,915,423],{}," when the request completes. When the bound value has no matching item, ",[291,918,919],{},"placeholder"," is shown, and the label appears automatically once the items arrive.",[339,922],{"name":923},"select-menu-async",[313,925,927],{"id":926},"dependent-menus","Dependent menus",[288,929,930,931,933],{},"When the city changes, the district is cleared, and the district ",[291,932,423],{}," are computed from the city.",[339,935],{"name":936},"select-menu-cascade",[313,938,940],{"id":939},"opening-the-menu","Opening the menu",[288,942,943,944,947,948,951],{},"Get the trigger button through ",[291,945,946],{},"triggerRef"," on the template ref and call ",[291,949,950],{},"click()"," to open the menu.",[339,953],{"name":954},"select-menu-expose",[308,956,958],{"id":957},"props","Props",[960,961],"component-props",{"name":396},[288,963,964,965,968,969,805,972,805,975,805,977,805,980,358,983,337],{},"See ",[300,966,102],{"href":967},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#shared-props"," for the behavior of ",[291,970,971],{},"size",[291,973,974],{},"disabled",[291,976,912],{},[291,978,979],{},"skeleton",[291,981,982],{},"id",[291,984,985],{},"name",[288,987,988,989,992,993,358,995,998],{},"When ",[291,990,991],{},"open"," is not set, the user opens and closes the menu; there is no v-model for it. The types of ",[291,994,562],{},[291,996,997],{},"clearIcon"," are inferred from another Nuxt UI generic that this component does not provide, so they are not in its types.",[308,1000,1002],{"id":1001},"slots","Slots",[288,1004,1005,1006,1008,1009,805,1012,805,1015,805,1018,805,1021,1024],{},"Every slot of ",[291,1007,762],{}," is available (",[291,1